{"unit_id":"AKS1st__model-usage-plugin#card-card-zh","repo":"AKS1st/model-usage-plugin","commit":"a8d1a444ffb02faa2818d12d6f0f1a1c22df1e57","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"model-usage-plugin 是面向 DSH Web 的模型用量统计与费用估算面板。它在模型流调用和会话事件中采集 Token、工具调用等数据，并将统计保存在本地文件。面板提供按模型查看用量与估算费用、趋势和活跃度图表、模型价格及汇率配置、DeepSeek 账户余额查询等功能。适合想了解模型消耗和费用构成的 DSH Web 用户；余额查询可选配置 DeepSeek API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:1641-1665","src/index.js:1503-1515","src/index.js:2172-2195","src/client.js:1756-1759"]}
{"unit_id":"AKS1st__model-usage-plugin#card-card-en","repo":"AKS1st/model-usage-plugin","commit":"a8d1a444ffb02faa2818d12d6f0f1a1c22df1e57","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"model-usage-plugin adds a DSH Web panel for model usage and estimated costs. It collects token and tool activity, stores statistics locally, and shows per-model costs and usage trends. Users can configure prices and exchange rates or optionally query their DeepSeek account balance with an API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:1641-1665","src/index.js:1503-1515","src/index.js:2172-2195","src/client.js:1756-1759"]}
